---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout lang="en" title="Patrick Paul | Digital Infrastructure Specialist" description="Senior digital infrastructure specialist focused on Linux, DevOps, automation, IoT, and applied technical systems.">
  <main>
    <section class="hero" aria-labelledby="hero-title">
      <p class="eyebrow">Senior Digital Infrastructure Specialist</p>
      <h1 id="hero-title">Building practical systems that connect infrastructure, automation, and the physical world.</h1>
      <p class="lead">Linux, DevOps and IoT practitioner with more than 20 years of experience supporting research and technical environments. I turn complex systems into reliable, understandable, and useful platforms.</p>
      <div class="actions">
        <a class="button primary" href="#contact">Discuss an opportunity</a>
        <a class="button" href="#projects">View selected projects</a>
      </div>
    </section>
    <section id="projects" aria-labelledby="projects-title">
      <p class="eyebrow">Foundation preview</p>
      <h2 id="projects-title">Selected project stories are coming next.</h2>
      <p class="lead">The next milestone will introduce EdgeX Foundry integration, Linux and container automation, and Raspberry Pi and microcontroller projects.</p>
    </section>
    <section id="contact" aria-labelledby="contact-title">
      <h2 id="contact-title">Open to meaningful technical opportunities.</h2>
    </section>
  </main>
</BaseLayout>
